\vspace{0.24cm}

{\fontsize{34}{40}\selectfont\bfseries\color{ImperialPurple}\kaiti\selectfont 隱}\\[0.10cm]
{\fontsize{16}{20}\selectfont\scshape\color{CommentaryBrown} Hidden}

\vspace{0.20cm}
{\fontsize{22}{26}\selectfont\bfseries\kaiti\selectfont 以斯帖記研讀}\\[0.08cm]
{\fontsize{13}{16}\selectfont\itshape\color{TextGray} A Study of the Book of Esther}

\vspace{0.24cm}
{\fontsize{15}{18}\selectfont\itshape\color{ImperialPurple} מִי יוֹדֵעַ}\quad
{\footnotesize\scshape\color{CommentaryBrown} “mi yode'a”}\quad
{\footnotesize\bfseries\color{NightIndigo} 焉知 \textperiodcentered\ Who knows}

\vfill

\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{white}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.3in}
\centering\vspace{0.15cm}
{\footnotesize\color{ImperialPurple}\kaiti\selectfont
「焉知你得了王后的位分不是為現今的機會嗎？」}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\itshape\color{TextGray}
“And who knows whether you have not attained royalty for such a time as this?”}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\color{ImperialPurple} 以斯帖記 4:14 \textperiodcentered\ Esther 4:14}
\vspace{0.15cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
\cleardoublepage

%% ============================================
%% FRONTISPIECE — "全書一句話" spread built on Mordecai's question (4:14),
%% the same role Ruth 1:16, Job 42:5-6 and Isaiah 12:2-3 play in the
%% sister volumes.
%% ============================================
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ImperialPurple} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
此時你若閉口不言，猶大人必從別處得解脫，蒙拯救；\\
你和你父家必致滅亡。\textbf{\color{HiddenCrimson!80!black}焉知你得了王后的位分}\\
\textbf{\color{HiddenCrimson!80!black}不是為現今的機會嗎}？\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
For if you remain silent at this time, relief and deliverance will arise for the Jews\\
from another place and you and your father's house will perish.\\
And \textbf{who knows whether you have not attained royalty for such a time as this?}\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ImperialPurple} 以斯帖記 4:14 \textperiodcentered\ Esther 4:14
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 十章 \textperiodcentered\ 四卷 \textperiodcentered\ 一本沒有神名、卻處處是神的書\\
\textit{Ten chapters \textperiodcentered\ four volumes \textperiodcentered\ a book without the Name, and full of God}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{4.3cm}p{1.9cm}p{5.8cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{卷別} & \textbf{章別} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
卷一 \textperiodcentered\ 隱 (Hidden) & 第1–2章 & 先預備，後患難 \\
卷二 \textperiodcentered\ 危 (Endangered) & 第3–4章 & 危機公開，神仍不出聲 \\
卷三 \textperiodcentered\ 轉 (Turned) & 第5–7章 & 翻轉靠一串「恰巧」 \\
卷四 \textperiodcentered\ 定 (Settled) & 第8–10章 & 翻轉寫進律法、日曆與記憶 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ImperialPurple} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一則宮廷選美的傳奇，是來看神如何在祂的名字一次也沒有出現的書卷裏，
藉一個孤女、一個不肯下跪的人、一個睡不著的王，把整個民族從滅絕的詔書下帶出來。\\
若你讀完十章，只記得「以斯帖很勇敢」——請從頭再讀，\\
這次留意：全書沒有神蹟、沒有異象、沒有一句「耶和華說」，神卻在每一個「恰巧」的背後。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not reading a palace beauty-contest romance — you are watching God, in
a book where His name never once appears, bring a whole people out from under a
decree of annihilation through an orphan girl, a man who would not bow, and a
king who could not sleep.\\
If after ten chapters you remember only “Esther was brave,” read it again.\\
This time notice: no miracle, no vision, not one “Thus says the LORD” — yet
God stands behind every coincidence.}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
\cleardoublepage

